 "notes": "p. 88 row 1 (end of Appendix, Nebseni Ch. XXV) skipped; Ani's Chapter XXVI starts p. 88 row 2 and ends p. 89 last row ('pert em ḥetep'); Chapter XXX B fills p. 90 to the rule. Line numerals as printed: Ch. XXVI 1. (row 2 start), 2. (before em, p.88 row 2), 3. (inside aki, after the double reed — aki kept on line 2), 4. (before t'eṭu-à), 5. (before seśu-nà), 6. (before reṭ-à, p.89 row 1), 7. (before Seχet), 8. (before ḥāti-à), 9. (before àn, p.89 row 7). Ch. XXX B 1. (Re), 2. (before ertāt), 3. (before sep sen), 4. (before χat-à). Overlines: p.88 row 2 Re..en (ends before Àusàr); p.90 row 1 Re..en (ends before Àusàr); p.90 row 2 from the N35 of nef to row end (χer not covered); p.90 row 3 Neter-χert and t'eṭ-f. English-only bracketed insertions with no hieroglyphs: '[Ani saith:]' (p.88 row 2), '[that]' (p.88 row 7). Recurrent U15-shaped sign (curled left end, tab at right) in seχer, un, seśu, śeṭentet, qerfi, θesu, seχem, χenà-tu, χesef: coded U15. A small superscript tick between G29 and A1 in ba-à (p.89 row 7) not coded. Ani's name has three strokes under N35 on p.88, two on p.90."
